{"id":"98a6e5a5a08ea634","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/623_线性时态模态逻辑.md","title":"623 线性时态模态逻辑","display":"623_线性时态模态逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 为有限集}\\},\\qquad\nX^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 为有限集}\\},\\qquad\nX^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子的类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{always}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{always}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nXA=\\operatorname{next}(A),\\quad GA=\\operatorname{always}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\nXA=\\operatorname{next}(A),\\quad GA=\\operatorname{always}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad FA=\\neg G\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad FA=\\neg G\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(GA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{623}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{623}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(GA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(GA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{623}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{623}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{623}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span> 为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{623}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{623}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{623}\n=\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}^{\\mathsf{Prop}}:\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{623}\n=\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}^{\\mathsf{Prop}}:\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{623}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{623}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{623}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{623}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{623}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{623}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{623}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{623}\\)</span> 的扩张递归满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(GA)=G\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(GA)=G\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,623}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,623}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{623}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{623}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{623}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{623}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{623}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{623}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{623}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{623}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>线性时态模态公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{623}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{623}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GK}^{623}=\\{G(A\\to B)\\to(GA\\to GB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{GK}^{623}=\\{G(A\\to B)\\to(GA\\to GB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{X\\neg}^{623}=\\{X\\neg A\\leftrightarrow\\neg XA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{X\\neg}^{623}=\\{X\\neg A\\leftrightarrow\\neg XA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{623}=\\{GA\\leftrightarrow(A\\land XGA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{623}=\\{GA\\leftrightarrow(A\\land XGA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GInd}^{623}=\\{G(A\\to XA)\\to(A\\to GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{GInd}^{623}=\\{G(A\\to XA)\\to(A\\to GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{623}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{623}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{623}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{X\\neg}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GK}^{623}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GInd}^{623}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{623}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{623}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{623}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{X\\neg}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GK}^{623}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GInd}^{623}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{623}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{623}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{623}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{623}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{623}=\\{((A),GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{623}=\\{((A),GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{623}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{623}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{623}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{623}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{623}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{XA}\\ (NecX),\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{GA}\\ (NecG).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{XA}\\ (NecX),\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{GA}\\ (NecG).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\)</span>。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>-证明是序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m},\\qquad\nm\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\quad\n(\\Delta_i,A_i)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{623})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m},\\qquad\nm\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\quad\n(\\Delta_i,A_i)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{623})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>假设行：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>公理行：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{623}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{623}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>MP 行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>NecX 行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=XA_j\">\\(A_i=XA_j\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>NecG 行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=GA_j\">\\(A_i=GA_j\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{623}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{623}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的序列的集合，并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{623}(\\pi)=A_{m-1},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{623}(\\pi)=\\Delta_{m-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{623}(\\pi)=A_{m-1},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{623}(\\pi)=\\Delta_{m-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{623}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{623}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{623}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{623}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，使</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{623}(\\pi)=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{623}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{623}(\\pi)=A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dep}_{623}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{623}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{623}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{623}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{623}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限证书关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{623}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{623}(\\Gamma),\n\\operatorname{last}_{623}(\\pi)=A,\n\\operatorname{dep}_{623}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{623}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{623}(\\Gamma),\n\\operatorname{last}_{623}(\\pi)=A,\n\\operatorname{dep}_{623}(\\pi)\\subseteq\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-线性时间语义\">9. 线性时间语义</h1>\n<p>线性时间模型类定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623}\n=\n\\{(T,\\operatorname{next},V):T\\ne\\varnothing,\n\\operatorname{next}:T\\to T,\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(T),\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N\\to T\n(e\\text{ 为双射}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\n\\operatorname{next}(e(n))=e(n+1))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623}\n=\n\\{(T,\\operatorname{next},V):T\\ne\\varnothing,\n\\operatorname{next}:T\\to T,\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(T),\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N\\to T\n(e\\text{ 为双射}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\n\\operatorname{next}(e(n))=e(n+1))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下固定任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(T,\\operatorname{next},V)\\in\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623}\">\\(\\mathcal M=(T,\\operatorname{next},V)\\in\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623}\\)</span>。递归定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{next}^{0}(t)=t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{next}^{n+1}(t)=\\operatorname{next}(\\operatorname{next}^{n}(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{next}^{0}(t)=t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{next}^{n+1}(t)=\\operatorname{next}(\\operatorname{next}^{n}(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{623}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}=T\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}=(T\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}=T\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}=(T\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ XA⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{next}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ XA⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{next}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ GA⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{next}^{n}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ GA⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{next}^{n}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{623}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nt\\in⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{623}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nt\\in⟦ A⟧_{623}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{623}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(T,\\operatorname{next},V)\\in\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623}\\ \\forall t\\in T\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{623}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{623}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{623}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(T,\\operatorname{next},V)\\in\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623}\\ \\forall t\\in T\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{623}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{623}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目使用线性时态构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{X\\neg}^{623}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{X\\neg}^{623}\\)</span> 固定总的确定性后继，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{623}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{623}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GInd}^{623}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{GInd}^{623}\\)</span> 分别给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的展开与归纳闭包；第 9 节要求时间框架与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-链同构，因而不是任意函数框架。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LTM}_{623}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\\operatorname{FV}_{623},\\operatorname{BV}_{623},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{623},\\operatorname{Sub}_{623},\\equiv_{\\alpha,623},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{623},\\mathsf{Rule}_{623},\\mathsf{Proof}_{623},\\operatorname{last}_{623},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{623},\\vdash_{623},\\mathsf{Thm}_{623},\n\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623},⟦-⟧_{623},\\Vdash_{623},\\models_{623}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LTM}_{623}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{623},\\operatorname{FV}_{623},\\operatorname{BV}_{623},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{623},\\operatorname{Sub}_{623},\\equiv_{\\alpha,623},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{623},\\mathsf{Rule}_{623},\\mathsf{Proof}_{623},\\operatorname{last}_{623},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{623},\\vdash_{623},\\mathsf{Thm}_{623},\n\\mathsf{LTimeMod}_{623},⟦-⟧_{623},\\Vdash_{623},\\models_{623}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由线性时态模态句法、公理、规则、证明关系以及后继时间语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>不在本条目中断言可靠性、完备性或模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-线性时间语义","text":"9. 线性时间语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\